WEBVTT

00:00:16.721 --> 00:00:19.097
<i>Drew: like when you put
on "a little" eye shadow.</i>

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.591
<i>And, you know, all this stuff,</i>

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.599
<i>It's just very unprofessional.</i>

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:30.210
<i>Don't touch the troll!</i>

00:00:30.243 --> 00:00:32.686
<i>Is that what your mom
used to say to your dates?</i>

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.150
<i>Put the trolls down,</i>

00:00:40.183 --> 00:00:42.291
<i>Or i'll put a staple
right between your eyes.</i>

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:45.036
<i>Now, i know it's hard.</i>

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:47.847
<i>It's hard to look up when you're down.</i>

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.691
<i>It's hard to look up and see the light.</i>

00:00:50.725 --> 00:00:53.971
<i>But i'm here to tell you folks...</i>

00:00:54.005 --> 00:00:55.645
<i>The lord is with you.</i>

00:01:07.023 --> 00:01:09.600
<i>You don't have to suffer.</i>

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:11.608
<i>You don't have to be lost.</i>

00:01:11.642 --> 00:01:13.783
<i>The lord is talking to you right now.</i>

00:01:13.817 --> 00:01:16.997
<i>He's saying, "you are my
child, and you have a purpose."</i>

00:01:18.302 --> 00:01:21.113
<i>You think god forgot
about you? I tell you, no!</i>

00:01:21.146 --> 00:01:22.719
<i>All you got to do is listen.</i>

00:01:22.753 --> 00:01:25.297
<i>Can't you just hear
those angels singing?</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:26.869
<i>Isn't it beautiful?</i>

00:01:29.279 --> 00:01:31.119
<i>It's time.</i>

00:01:31.153 --> 00:01:34.031
<i>It's time to receive
the message he's sending.</i>

00:01:34.065 --> 00:01:37.678
<i>It's time to listen to the word of god!</i>

00:01:37.712 --> 00:01:40.457
<i>Can you hear the glory?</i>

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:42.431
<i>I said, can't you just hear it?</i>

00:01:42.465 --> 00:01:45.175
<i>I say, can't you just hear the lord?</i>

00:02:21.972 --> 00:02:24.515
Good morning. You're not the usual guy.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.635
No, uh... just filling in.

00:02:29.669 --> 00:02:32.046
So, how you feeling today, gloria?

00:02:32.079 --> 00:02:34.655
I've never felt better.

00:02:34.689 --> 00:02:38.137
So, no disturbances lately?

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.881
You mean, am i stark-Raving
cuckoo for cocoa puffs?

00:02:40.914 --> 00:02:43.491
I didn't say that.

00:02:43.525 --> 00:02:45.733
It's all right. I know
what people must think.

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:48.143
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:02:48.177 --> 00:02:50.653
I think what i saw was real.

00:03:03.705 --> 00:03:06.583
I'd like to know what you saw.

00:03:09.897 --> 00:03:12.071
It was all over the news.

00:03:12.106 --> 00:03:13.879
I stabbed a man in the heart.

00:03:13.913 --> 00:03:15.719
Why would you do that?

00:03:15.753 --> 00:03:17.526
Because it was god's will.

00:03:19.099 --> 00:03:20.907
Did god talk to you?

00:03:20.941 --> 00:03:24.655
I get the sense god's a
little busy for house calls.

00:03:24.689 --> 00:03:27.935
No, he -- He
sent someone.

00:03:27.969 --> 00:03:29.341
Someone?

00:03:29.374 --> 00:03:31.382
An angel.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:37.673
It came to me in this
beautiful white light.

00:03:37.707 --> 00:03:42.827
And it filled me with this...feeling.

00:03:42.861 --> 00:03:45.705
It's -- It's
hard to describe.

00:03:45.739 --> 00:03:47.346
And this angel...

00:03:47.379 --> 00:03:49.219
Spoke god's word.

00:03:49.254 --> 00:03:53.069
And the word was to kill someone?

00:03:53.102 --> 00:03:56.515
I know it sounds strange.

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:58.757
But what i did was very important.

00:03:58.791 --> 00:04:01.101
I helped him smite an evil man.

00:04:01.134 --> 00:04:04.045
I was chosen...

00:04:04.079 --> 00:04:06.590
For redemption.

00:04:06.622 --> 00:04:09.567
This man you stabbed -- Did
the angel give you his name?

00:04:09.602 --> 00:04:10.906
No.

00:04:10.939 --> 00:04:13.683
He just told me to wait for the sign,

00:04:13.717 --> 00:04:15.458
And the very next day,

00:04:15.491 --> 00:04:17.733
I saw it right beside the man's doorway,

00:04:17.766 --> 00:04:18.938
And i knew.

00:04:18.971 --> 00:04:20.042
Why him?

00:04:20.075 --> 00:04:22.619
I just know what
the angel told me --

00:04:22.654 --> 00:04:26.367
That this man was guilty
to his deepest foundations.

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.317
And that was good enough for me.

00:04:50.463 --> 00:04:52.606
Hey.

00:04:59.734 --> 00:05:01.106
Sam: hey!

00:05:02.445 --> 00:05:04.854
Hey, man, you got to try this.

00:05:04.887 --> 00:05:07.197
I mean, there really is
magic in the magic fingers.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:10.075
Dean, you're enjoying that way too much.

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:12.250
It's kind of making me uncomfortable.

00:05:12.283 --> 00:05:14.927
You got me on lockdown here.
I'm bored out of my skull.

00:05:14.961 --> 00:05:19.345
Hey, you were the bank robber
on the 11:00 news, not me.

00:05:19.379 --> 00:05:21.955
We can't risk you just walking
into a government facility.

00:05:21.989 --> 00:05:22.993
Mmm.

00:05:28.783 --> 00:05:30.791
Aw, damn it.

00:05:30.825 --> 00:05:32.666
That was my last quarter.

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:34.338
Hey!

00:05:34.371 --> 00:05:36.246
You got any quarters?

00:05:36.279 --> 00:05:37.551
No.

00:05:39.593 --> 00:05:41.567
So, did you get in to
see that crazy hooker?

00:05:41.601 --> 00:05:43.509
Yeah. Gloria sitnik.

00:05:43.542 --> 00:05:45.349
And i'm not so sure she's crazy.

00:05:45.382 --> 00:05:47.089
But she seriously believes

00:05:47.122 --> 00:05:48.930
That she was... touched by an angel?

00:05:48.963 --> 00:05:50.570
Yeah.

00:05:50.603 --> 00:05:53.113
Blinding light, feelings of
spiritual ecstasy, the works.

00:05:53.146 --> 00:05:55.891
I mean, she's living in a locked ward,

00:05:55.925 --> 00:05:57.933
And she's totally at peace.

00:05:57.966 --> 00:06:00.007
Oh, yeah, you're right
-- Sounds completely sane.

00:06:00.042 --> 00:06:01.848
What about the dude she stabbed?

00:06:01.882 --> 00:06:03.354
Uh, carl gulley.

00:06:03.387 --> 00:06:05.161
Said she killed him 'cause he was evil.

00:06:05.194 --> 00:06:06.634
Was he? I don't know.

00:06:06.667 --> 00:06:08.675
I couldn't find any dirt on him.

00:06:08.709 --> 00:06:10.315
He didn't have a criminal record,

00:06:10.349 --> 00:06:12.725
He worked at the campus
library, had lots of friends,

00:06:12.758 --> 00:06:14.431
Was a churchgoer.

00:06:14.465 --> 00:06:17.577
Hmm. So gloria's just
your standard-Issue wacko?

00:06:17.611 --> 00:06:21.158
I mean, she wouldn't be
the first nutjob in history

00:06:21.191 --> 00:06:23.903
To kill in the name of
religion, know what i mean?

00:06:23.936 --> 00:06:25.677
No, but she's the second in town

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.818
To murder because an angel told them to.

00:06:27.851 --> 00:06:29.357
Little bit odd, don't you think?

00:06:29.391 --> 00:06:31.131
Odd -- Yeah.
Supernatural -- Maybe.

00:06:31.166 --> 00:06:32.871
But angels -- I
don't think so.

00:06:32.906 --> 00:06:34.377
Why not?

00:06:34.411 --> 00:06:37.289
'Cause there's no such thing, sam.

00:06:37.322 --> 00:06:40.737
Dean, there's 10 times
as much lore about angels

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.214
As there is about anything
else we've ever hunted.

00:06:43.246 --> 00:06:45.121
There's a ton of lore on unicorns, too.

00:06:45.154 --> 00:06:47.831
I hear that they ride
on silver moonbeams

00:06:47.865 --> 00:06:50.074
And they shoot rainbows
out of their ass.

00:06:50.107 --> 00:06:52.082
Wait, there's no such thing as unicorns?

00:06:52.115 --> 00:06:54.023
That's cute.

00:06:54.056 --> 00:06:56.599
I'm just saying, man,
there's some legends

00:06:56.633 --> 00:06:59.846
That you just file under "bull crap."

00:06:59.879 --> 00:07:02.590
And you got angels on
the "bull crap" list?

00:07:02.623 --> 00:07:03.661
Yep.

00:07:03.694 --> 00:07:04.765
Why?

00:07:04.799 --> 00:07:07.275
Because i've never seen one.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:08.547
So what?

00:07:08.581 --> 00:07:11.058
So i believe in what i can see.

00:07:11.091 --> 00:07:12.931
Dean, you and i have seen things

00:07:12.965 --> 00:07:14.906
Most people couldn't even dream about.

00:07:14.939 --> 00:07:16.511
Exactly.

00:07:16.545 --> 00:07:18.922
With our own eyes --
That's hard proof, okay?

00:07:18.955 --> 00:07:20.394
But in all this time,

00:07:20.427 --> 00:07:22.871
I have never seen anything
that looks like an angel.

00:07:22.905 --> 00:07:25.849
Don't you think we would
have crossed paths with them

00:07:25.883 --> 00:07:28.159
Or at least know someone
that crossed paths with them?

00:07:28.192 --> 00:07:30.937
No. This is a demon or a spirit.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.414
They find people a few
fries short of a happy meal,

00:07:33.446 --> 00:07:35.354
And they trick them into
killing these randoms.

00:07:35.387 --> 00:07:37.295
Maybe.

00:07:39.939 --> 00:07:42.349
Can we just -- I'm
going stir-Crazy, man.

00:07:42.382 --> 00:07:45.194
Let's go by gloria's apartment, huh?

00:07:45.227 --> 00:07:47.602
I was just there. Nothing.

00:07:47.635 --> 00:07:49.343
No sulfur, no e.M.F.

00:07:49.377 --> 00:07:52.490
You didn't see any fluffy,
white wing feathers?

00:07:53.894 --> 00:07:56.371
But gloria did say the
angel gave her a sign

00:07:56.405 --> 00:07:58.713
Right beside carl gulley's doorway.

00:07:58.747 --> 00:08:01.826
Could be something at his
house. It's worth checking out.

00:08:27.897 --> 00:08:30.440
Hey, sam.

00:08:30.474 --> 00:08:32.983
Think i found it.

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:38.589
It's a sign from up above.

00:08:44.714 --> 00:08:47.692
I think i learned a valuable lesson.

00:08:47.726 --> 00:08:50.135
Always take down your
christmas decorations

00:08:50.168 --> 00:08:51.474
After new year's,

00:08:51.507 --> 00:08:54.451
Or you might get filleted
by a hooker from god.

00:08:54.486 --> 00:08:58.803
I'm laughing on the inside.

00:09:21.025 --> 00:09:22.563
You know, gloria said

00:09:22.598 --> 00:09:24.907
The guy was guilty to
his deepest foundations.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.522
You think she literally
meant the foundation?

00:09:48.133 --> 00:09:50.242
Hmm.

00:10:12.296 --> 00:10:15.710
You got something?

00:10:17.818 --> 00:10:19.491
What is it?

00:10:23.675 --> 00:10:25.750
It's a fingernail.

00:10:46.767 --> 00:10:50.548
So much for the innocent
churchgoing librarian.

00:10:50.582 --> 00:10:52.490
Whatever spoke to gloria about this

00:10:52.523 --> 00:10:55.234
Knew what it was talking
about -- I'll give you that.

00:12:44.703 --> 00:12:45.774
Yes?

00:12:45.807 --> 00:12:48.652
Hi. My name is zach.

00:12:48.686 --> 00:12:50.192
Can i help you?

00:12:51.496 --> 00:12:53.471
Ugh!

00:13:21.118 --> 00:13:23.126
Did you bring quarters?

00:13:27.025 --> 00:13:30.661
Dude, i'm not enabling your sick habit.

00:13:30.739 --> 00:13:33.133
You're like one of those lab rats

00:13:33.146 --> 00:13:35.174
That pushes the pleasure button
instead of the food button

00:13:35.187 --> 00:13:35.990
Until it dies.

00:13:36.476 --> 00:13:38.417
What are you talking about?
I eat. And i got news.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.458
Me too. All right, you go first.

00:13:40.492 --> 00:13:42.668
Three students have disappeared
off the campus this year.

00:13:42.701 --> 00:13:44.340
All of them were last
seen at the library.

00:13:44.374 --> 00:13:47.821
Where carl gulley worked. Sick bastard.

00:13:47.854 --> 00:13:49.461
So gloria's
angel -- Angel?

00:13:49.494 --> 00:13:51.469
Okay, whatever this thing is.

00:13:51.502 --> 00:13:54.313
Whatever it is, it struck again. What?

00:13:54.347 --> 00:13:56.188
I was listening to the police radio.

00:13:56.221 --> 00:13:58.396
There was this guy, zach
smith, some local drunk.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:00.538
He went up to a stranger's
front door last night,

00:14:00.572 --> 00:14:02.112
Stabbed him in the heart.

00:14:02.144 --> 00:14:04.554
I'm guessing he went to
the police and confessed?

00:14:04.588 --> 00:14:06.696
Yep. Roma downey made him do it.

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:08.805
Now, i, uh...

00:14:08.838 --> 00:14:12.385
Got the victim's address.

00:14:46.405 --> 00:14:47.944
Find anything?

00:14:47.977 --> 00:14:50.153
Frank liked his catalog shopping.

00:14:50.187 --> 00:14:52.093
That's about all i got. You?

00:14:52.127 --> 00:14:53.968
Not much here.

00:14:54.001 --> 00:14:56.947
Except he's got this one locked
file on his computer that...

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:58.486
Hold on.

00:15:06.183 --> 00:15:08.860
Not anymore.

00:15:10.601 --> 00:15:13.077
God. What?

00:15:13.111 --> 00:15:14.884
He's got all these e-Mails,

00:15:14.917 --> 00:15:18.031
Dozens, to this lady named jennifer.

00:15:22.113 --> 00:15:25.259
This lady who's 13 years old.

00:15:25.293 --> 00:15:27.200
Oh, i don't want to hear this.

00:15:27.233 --> 00:15:29.644
Looks like they met in a chat room.

00:15:29.677 --> 00:15:33.927
These e-Mails are
pretty personal, dean.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.400
Look at that.

00:15:35.433 --> 00:15:38.177
Setting up a time and
place to meet. Great.

00:15:38.211 --> 00:15:41.892
They were supposed to meet today.

00:15:43.365 --> 00:15:44.469
Huh.

00:15:44.503 --> 00:15:47.079
Well, i guess if you're
gonna stab someone,

00:15:47.113 --> 00:15:49.087
Good timing.

00:15:49.121 --> 00:15:51.564
I don't know, man. This is weird.

00:15:51.597 --> 00:15:54.811
I mean, sure, some spirits
are out for vengeance,

00:15:54.844 --> 00:15:57.387
But this one's almost
like a do-Gooder, like a --

00:15:57.421 --> 00:15:59.228
Avenging angel?

00:15:59.261 --> 00:16:02.340
Well, how else do you explain it, dean?

00:16:02.373 --> 00:16:04.348
Three guys not connected to each other

00:16:04.381 --> 00:16:06.021
All stabbed through the heart?

00:16:06.055 --> 00:16:08.599
At least two were world-Class pervs,

00:16:08.632 --> 00:16:10.875
And i bet if you dug deep
enough on the other guy --

00:16:10.908 --> 00:16:12.313
Hey. What?

00:16:12.347 --> 00:16:14.221
You said carl gulley
was a churchgoer, right?

00:16:14.255 --> 00:16:15.325
Yeah.

00:16:15.359 --> 00:16:17.701
What was the name of his church?

00:16:17.736 --> 00:16:21.852
Uh... our lady of the angels?

00:16:21.885 --> 00:16:23.960
Of course that would be the name.

00:16:23.993 --> 00:16:26.101
Looks like frank went
to the same church.

00:16:36.175 --> 00:16:38.351
Man: so, you're interested
in joining the parish?

00:16:38.384 --> 00:16:41.195
We just don't feel right unless
we hit church every sunday.

00:16:41.228 --> 00:16:42.768
Where'd you say you lived before?

00:16:42.801 --> 00:16:44.108
Premont, texas.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:47.453
Really? At's a nice
town. St. Teresa's parish.

00:16:47.487 --> 00:16:49.027
You must know the priest there.

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:52.205
Sure, yeah. No, it's fr. O'malley.

00:16:52.239 --> 00:16:54.683
I know a fr. Shaughnessy.

00:16:54.716 --> 00:16:56.691
Shaughnessy, exactly. What did i say?

00:16:56.724 --> 00:16:58.832
You know, we're just happy
to be here now, father.

00:16:58.865 --> 00:17:00.104
And we're happy to have you.

00:17:00.137 --> 00:17:03.016
We could use some
young blood around here.

00:17:03.049 --> 00:17:05.425
I got to ask -- No offense,
but the neighborhood...

00:17:05.459 --> 00:17:07.901
It's gone to seed a little.
There's no denying that.

00:17:07.936 --> 00:17:10.311
But that's why what the church
does here is so important.

00:17:10.344 --> 00:17:12.319
Like i always say, you
can expect a miracle,

00:17:12.352 --> 00:17:14.360
But in the meantime,
you work your butt off.

00:17:14.393 --> 00:17:16.135
Yeah, we heard about the murders.

00:17:16.168 --> 00:17:18.076
The victims were parishioners of mine.

00:17:18.109 --> 00:17:19.681
I've known them for years.

00:17:19.715 --> 00:17:22.359
And the killers said that
an angel made them do that?

00:17:22.392 --> 00:17:24.535
Yes. Misguided souls.

00:17:24.568 --> 00:17:26.308
To think that god's messenger

00:17:26.341 --> 00:17:29.387
Would appear and incite people
to murder -- It's tragic.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:31.864
So, you don't believe in
those angel yarns, huh?

00:17:31.897 --> 00:17:33.604
Oh, no, i absolutely believe.

00:17:33.637 --> 00:17:35.511
It kind of goes with
the job description.

00:17:35.545 --> 00:17:37.955
Father, that's michael, right?

00:17:37.988 --> 00:17:40.029
That's right.

00:17:40.064 --> 00:17:44.113
The archangel michael,
with the flaming sword --

00:17:44.146 --> 00:17:46.521
The fighter of demons,

00:17:46.555 --> 00:17:49.533
Holy force against evil.

00:17:49.567 --> 00:17:51.609
So, they're not really
the hallmark-Card version

00:17:51.643 --> 00:17:53.684
That everybody thinks?

00:17:53.717 --> 00:17:55.557
They're fierce, right? Vigilant.

00:17:55.591 --> 00:17:58.303
I like to think of them as
more loving than wrathful,

00:17:58.336 --> 00:18:00.076
But, yes,

00:18:00.109 --> 00:18:03.857
A lot of scripture paints
angels as god's warriors.

00:18:03.891 --> 00:18:06.436
"An angel of the lord appeared to them,

00:18:06.468 --> 00:18:09.313
"The glory of the lord
shone down upon them,

00:18:09.347 --> 00:18:12.325
And they were terrified."

00:18:16.541 --> 00:18:19.152
Luke 2:9.

00:18:25.076 --> 00:18:27.184
Well, thank you for
speaking with us, father.

00:18:27.217 --> 00:18:29.293
It's my pleasure. Hope to see you again.

00:18:29.326 --> 00:18:31.435
Father, what's all that for?

00:18:32.739 --> 00:18:35.985
Oh, that's for fr. Gregory.
He was a priest here.

00:18:36.019 --> 00:18:37.224
Was?

00:18:37.257 --> 00:18:39.031
Passed away right on these steps.

00:18:39.065 --> 00:18:40.905
He's interred in the church crypt.

00:18:40.939 --> 00:18:42.679
When did this happen?

00:18:42.712 --> 00:18:46.093
Two months ago. He was
shot for his car keys.

00:18:46.127 --> 00:18:47.264
I'm sorry.

00:18:47.297 --> 00:18:50.744
Yeah, me too. He was a good friend.

00:18:50.777 --> 00:18:54.325
I didn't even have time to
administer his last rites.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.768
But like i said, it's
a tough neighborhood.

00:18:56.801 --> 00:19:00.919
And ever since he died, i've
been praying my heart out.

00:19:00.952 --> 00:19:01.923
For what?

00:19:01.956 --> 00:19:03.295
For deliverance...

00:19:03.328 --> 00:19:05.637
From the violence and
the bloodshed around here.

00:19:07.143 --> 00:19:11.059
We could use a little divine
intervention, i suppose.

00:19:11.092 --> 00:19:13.669
Well, padre, thanks.

00:19:13.704 --> 00:19:15.309
We'll see you again.

00:19:27.659 --> 00:19:29.933
Well, it's all starting to make sense.

00:19:29.967 --> 00:19:32.344
Devoted priest dies
a violent death --

00:19:32.377 --> 00:19:34.920
That's vengeful-Spirit
material right there.

00:19:34.953 --> 00:19:37.364
He knew all the stiffs 'cause
they went to church here.

00:19:37.397 --> 00:19:39.339
I'm willing to bet,
because he was their priest,

00:19:39.372 --> 00:19:41.347
He knew things about them
that nobody else knew.

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:44.993
Then again, fr. Reynolds
started praying for god's help

00:19:45.027 --> 00:19:46.601
About two months ago, right?

00:19:46.634 --> 00:19:49.177
Right about the time all this started?

00:19:49.211 --> 00:19:52.055
Oh, come on, man. What's
your deal? What do you mean?

00:19:52.089 --> 00:19:54.029
Look, i'll admit, i'm
a bit of a skeptic,

00:19:54.063 --> 00:19:55.971
But since when are
you all mr. "700 club?"

00:19:56.004 --> 00:19:58.280
Seriously, from the get-Go,

00:19:58.313 --> 00:20:00.624
You've been willing to
buy this angel crap, man.

00:20:00.657 --> 00:20:03.702
What's next? Are you gonna
start praying every day?

00:20:03.736 --> 00:20:05.308
I do.

00:20:06.881 --> 00:20:07.852
What?

00:20:07.885 --> 00:20:10.161
I do pray every day.

00:20:10.195 --> 00:20:12.135
I have for a long time.

00:20:15.851 --> 00:20:18.360
The things you learn about a guy.

00:20:18.393 --> 00:20:20.536
Huh.

00:20:21.573 --> 00:20:25.120
Come on. Let's go check
out fr. Gregory's grave.

00:21:08.014 --> 00:21:09.789
Sam, come on, get the lead out.

00:21:12.097 --> 00:21:13.972
Sammy?

00:21:15.645 --> 00:21:17.720
Sammy! Hey.

00:21:18.757 --> 00:21:20.967
Okay?

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:22.740
Yeah.

00:21:22.773 --> 00:21:25.183
Yeah.

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.522
Come on.

00:21:34.905 --> 00:21:37.249
You saw it, didn't you? Didn't you?

00:21:37.282 --> 00:21:40.126
Yeah. Yeah.

00:21:40.159 --> 00:21:42.335
Dean, i saw an angel.

00:21:42.369 --> 00:21:44.242
You
--

00:21:46.485 --> 00:21:48.024
All right, come on.

00:21:50.166 --> 00:21:51.906
I don't want a drink.

00:21:55.354 --> 00:21:59.437
So, what makes you think
you saw a, uh, angel?

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:02.214
Just...

00:22:02.247 --> 00:22:04.590
It appeared before
me, and i just --

00:22:04.624 --> 00:22:07.602
This feeling washed over me, you know?

00:22:07.636 --> 00:22:10.982
Like -- Like
peace, like grace.

00:22:11.015 --> 00:22:13.358
Okay, ecstasy boy, maybe we'll get you

00:22:13.393 --> 00:22:16.170
Some glow sticks and a
nice dr. Seuss hat, huh?

00:22:16.203 --> 00:22:18.211
Dean, i'm serious.

00:22:18.245 --> 00:22:20.353
It spoke to me. It knew who i was.

00:22:20.386 --> 00:22:22.897
It's just a spirit, sam.

00:22:22.963 --> 00:22:25.071
And it's not the first one

00:22:25.105 --> 00:22:26.746
To be able to read people's minds.

00:22:26.779 --> 00:22:28.954
Okay, let
me guess --

00:22:28.987 --> 00:22:30.995
You were personally chosen
to smite some sinner?

00:22:31.029 --> 00:22:33.070
You just got to wait
for me divine bat signal.

00:22:33.103 --> 00:22:35.949
Is that it? Yeah, actually.

00:22:35.982 --> 00:22:38.057
Great.

00:22:38.090 --> 00:22:40.701
I don't suppose you asked
what this alleged bad guy did.

00:22:40.734 --> 00:22:44.851
Actually, i did, dean,
and the angel told me.

00:22:44.885 --> 00:22:47.159
He hasn't done anything... yet.

00:22:47.193 --> 00:22:49.637
But he will.

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:52.347
Oh, this is -- I
don't believe this.

00:22:52.381 --> 00:22:54.590
Dean, the angel hasn't been wrong yet.

00:22:54.623 --> 00:22:57.802
Someone's gonna do something
awful, and i can stop it.

00:22:57.836 --> 00:23:00.178
You're supposed to be bad, too, sam.

00:23:00.211 --> 00:23:01.685
Maybe i should stop you right now.

00:23:01.718 --> 00:23:03.659
You know what, dean? I don't understand.

00:23:03.693 --> 00:23:05.767
Why can't you even
consider the possibility?

00:23:05.801 --> 00:23:08.143
What, that this is an angel? Yes.

00:23:08.177 --> 00:23:11.255
Maybe we're hunting an angel
here, and we should stop.

00:23:11.289 --> 00:23:14.034
Maybe this is god's will.

00:23:14.067 --> 00:23:16.610
Okay. All right.

00:23:16.645 --> 00:23:18.753
You know what? I get
it. You've got faith.

00:23:18.786 --> 00:23:20.392
That's -- Hey,
good for you.

00:23:20.426 --> 00:23:22.199
I'm sure it makes things easier.

00:23:23.706 --> 00:23:25.982
I'll tell you who else
had faith like that -- Mom.

00:23:27.621 --> 00:23:29.763
She used to tell me
when she tucked me in

00:23:29.797 --> 00:23:32.006
That angels were watching over us.

00:23:32.039 --> 00:23:34.549
In fact, that was the last
thing she ever said to me.

00:23:34.582 --> 00:23:36.355
You never told me that.

00:23:36.389 --> 00:23:38.197
What's to tell?

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:39.870
She was wrong.

00:23:39.903 --> 00:23:42.849
There was nothing protecting her.

00:23:42.882 --> 00:23:46.229
There's no higher power. There's no god.

00:23:46.262 --> 00:23:49.374
There's just chaos and violence

00:23:49.407 --> 00:23:54.294
And random, unpredictable
evil that comes out of nowhere

00:23:54.327 --> 00:23:56.703
And rips you to shreds.

00:23:56.737 --> 00:23:59.281
You want me to believe in this stuff?

00:23:59.314 --> 00:24:01.222
I'm gonna need to see some hard proof.

00:24:01.255 --> 00:24:02.426
You got any?

00:24:04.903 --> 00:24:06.309
Well, i do.

00:24:06.342 --> 00:24:09.187
Proof that we're dealing with a spirit.

00:24:17.419 --> 00:24:19.059
That looks
like --

00:24:19.093 --> 00:24:20.598
It's wormwood...

00:24:20.632 --> 00:24:22.406
A plant associated with the dead,

00:24:22.439 --> 00:24:24.547
Specifically the ones
that are not at rest.

00:24:24.581 --> 00:24:26.925
I don't see it growing anywhere else,

00:24:26.958 --> 00:24:29.601
Except over the
murdered priest's marker.

00:24:29.634 --> 00:24:32.313
It's him, sam.

00:24:32.346 --> 00:24:34.254
Maybe.

00:24:35.692 --> 00:24:37.098
Maybe?

00:24:37.131 --> 00:24:38.973
Dean, i don't know what to think.

00:24:39.006 --> 00:24:40.678
Okay.

00:24:42.519 --> 00:24:44.929
Want some more proof?
I'll give you more proof.

00:24:44.962 --> 00:24:46.369
How?

00:24:46.402 --> 00:24:48.610
We'll summon gregory's spirit.

00:24:48.643 --> 00:24:50.250
What?

00:24:50.284 --> 00:24:53.095
Here? In the church?

00:24:53.129 --> 00:24:54.768
Yeah.

00:24:54.802 --> 00:24:57.947
Yeah, we just need a few odds and ends

00:24:57.981 --> 00:25:00.358
And that sance ritual in dad's journal.

00:25:00.391 --> 00:25:03.503
A sance, great. I
hope whoopi's available.

00:25:03.537 --> 00:25:05.711
That's funny, actually. Seriously.

00:25:07.218 --> 00:25:08.925
If fr. Gregory's spirit is around,

00:25:08.958 --> 00:25:10.832
The sance will bring him right to us.

00:25:10.866 --> 00:25:13.743
If it's him, then we'll put him to rest.

00:25:13.777 --> 00:25:15.986
But if it's an angel, it won't show.

00:25:16.019 --> 00:25:17.759
Nothing will happen.

00:25:17.793 --> 00:25:19.266
Exactly.

00:25:19.299 --> 00:25:21.174
It's one of the perks of the job, sam.

00:25:21.207 --> 00:25:22.914
We don't have to operate on faith.

00:25:22.947 --> 00:25:25.257
We can know for sure.

00:25:25.290 --> 00:25:27.398
Don't you want to know for sure?

00:25:34.025 --> 00:25:35.865
Dude...

00:25:35.898 --> 00:25:37.070
All right, i'll admit,

00:25:37.103 --> 00:25:39.714
We've gone pretty ghetto
with the spell work before,

00:25:39.747 --> 00:25:40.986
But this takes the cake.

00:25:41.019 --> 00:25:43.897
I mean, a spongebob place
mat instead of an altar cloth?

00:25:43.930 --> 00:25:46.206
We'll just put it
spongebob-Side-Down.

00:25:50.089 --> 00:25:51.662
Dean, that's it.

00:25:51.695 --> 00:25:52.733
What?

00:25:52.766 --> 00:25:55.242
That's the sign.

00:25:55.277 --> 00:25:57.016
Where?

00:25:57.050 --> 00:25:58.254
Right behind that guy.

00:25:58.289 --> 00:26:00.028
That's him, dean.

00:26:00.062 --> 00:26:02.438
And we have to stop him.

00:26:08.813 --> 00:26:10.085
Wait a minute.

00:26:10.118 --> 00:26:11.491
What are you doing?

00:26:11.524 --> 00:26:14.604
You're not gonna kill somebody
because a ghost told you to.

00:26:14.637 --> 00:26:16.980
I'm not gonna kill
him. I'm gonna stop him.

00:26:17.012 --> 00:26:20.192
Define "stop," huh? I
mean, what are you gonna do?

00:26:20.225 --> 00:26:21.966
Dean, please.

00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:23.840
He's gonna hurt someone. You know it.

00:26:26.417 --> 00:26:29.261
All right, come on.

00:26:35.319 --> 00:26:36.591
Dean.

00:26:37.964 --> 00:26:39.301
Unlock my door.

00:26:39.335 --> 00:26:41.477
You're not killing anyone, sam.

00:26:41.510 --> 00:26:43.451
I got this guy. You go do the sance.

00:26:43.485 --> 00:26:45.392
Dean.

00:28:16.823 --> 00:28:18.865
What are you doing?

00:28:18.898 --> 00:28:20.906
What is this?

00:28:24.153 --> 00:28:27.867
Father, please. I can explain.

00:28:27.901 --> 00:28:29.909
Uh...

00:28:29.942 --> 00:28:32.385
Actually, maybe i can't. Um...

00:28:35.230 --> 00:28:38.176
This is a... a sance.

00:28:38.209 --> 00:28:39.748
A sance?

00:28:39.781 --> 00:28:42.192
Young man, you are in a house of god.

00:28:42.225 --> 00:28:44.701
It's based on early christian
rites, if that helps.

00:28:44.734 --> 00:28:46.742
Enough. You're coming with me.

00:28:46.776 --> 00:28:49.687
Father, please, just wait a second.

00:28:52.197 --> 00:28:54.340
Oh, my god.

00:28:56.147 --> 00:28:58.456
Is that...

00:28:58.489 --> 00:29:00.229
Is that an angel?

00:29:00.264 --> 00:29:02.705
No, it's not.

00:29:02.739 --> 00:29:07.124
It's just fr. Gregory.

00:29:13.783 --> 00:29:15.256
Thomas!

00:29:15.289 --> 00:29:18.637
I've come in answer to your prayers.

00:29:37.879 --> 00:29:40.958
Sam....i thought i
sent you on your path.

00:29:40.992 --> 00:29:42.800
You should hurry.

00:29:44.071 --> 00:29:45.309
Father, i'm sorry.

00:29:48.221 --> 00:29:50.095
But you're not an angel.

00:29:50.128 --> 00:29:52.036
Of course i am.

00:29:52.069 --> 00:29:54.144
No.

00:29:54.177 --> 00:29:55.517
You're a man.

00:29:55.550 --> 00:29:59.231
You're a spirit.

00:29:59.265 --> 00:30:01.038
And you need to rest.

00:30:01.072 --> 00:30:03.481
I was a man...

00:30:03.516 --> 00:30:05.021
But now i'm an angel.

00:30:07.565 --> 00:30:10.342
I was on the steps at the church.

00:30:10.376 --> 00:30:13.622
I felt that bullet
pierce right through me.

00:30:13.656 --> 00:30:16.500
But there was no pain.

00:30:16.533 --> 00:30:19.780
And, suddenly, i could see...

00:30:19.813 --> 00:30:21.453
Everything.

00:30:23.996 --> 00:30:25.837
Fr. Reynolds, i saw you...

00:30:25.872 --> 00:30:28.782
Praying and crying here.

00:30:28.816 --> 00:30:31.861
I came to help you.

00:30:31.896 --> 00:30:33.904
Help me how?

00:31:01.546 --> 00:31:03.120
Damn it!

00:31:04.525 --> 00:31:06.197
Those
murders --

00:31:06.231 --> 00:31:08.942
That was because of you?

00:31:08.976 --> 00:31:10.850
I received the word of god.

00:31:10.884 --> 00:31:13.862
He spoke to me, told
me to smite the wicked.

00:31:13.896 --> 00:31:16.105
I'm carrying out his will.

00:31:16.138 --> 00:31:18.113
You're driving innocent people to kill.

00:31:18.146 --> 00:31:21.559
Those innocent people are
being offered redemption.

00:31:24.437 --> 00:31:26.345
Some people need redemption.

00:31:26.378 --> 00:31:28.420
Don't they, sam?

00:31:29.825 --> 00:31:31.565
How can you call this redemption?

00:31:33.741 --> 00:31:36.017
You can't understand it now.

00:31:36.050 --> 00:31:38.493
But the rules of man
and the rules of god

00:31:38.527 --> 00:31:39.933
Are two very different things.

00:31:39.966 --> 00:31:43.949
Those people --
They're locked up.

00:31:43.982 --> 00:31:45.521
No, they're happy.

00:31:45.555 --> 00:31:48.936
They've found peace,
beaten their demons.

00:31:48.969 --> 00:31:51.312
And i've given them the keys to heaven.

00:31:51.344 --> 00:31:53.320
No, no. This is vengeance.

00:31:53.352 --> 00:31:54.758
It's wrong.

00:31:54.792 --> 00:31:57.837
Thomas, this goes against
everything you believed.

00:31:57.871 --> 00:31:59.945
You're lost, misguided.

00:31:59.980 --> 00:32:03.459
Father... no, i'm not misguided.

00:32:03.493 --> 00:32:05.802
You are not an angel, thomas.

00:32:05.836 --> 00:32:08.012
Men cannot be angels.

00:32:10.889 --> 00:32:13.300
But...

00:32:13.333 --> 00:32:16.210
But i-I don't understand.

00:32:20.594 --> 00:32:22.234
You prayed for me to come.

00:32:22.268 --> 00:32:24.711
I prayed for god's help, not this.

00:32:24.744 --> 00:32:28.158
What you're doing is not god's will.

00:32:28.192 --> 00:32:30.333
"Thou shalt not kill."

00:32:30.368 --> 00:32:32.376
That's the word of god.

00:32:41.144 --> 00:32:42.984
How come we stopped?

00:32:48.305 --> 00:32:52.655
Um, weren't we gonna go to the movies?

00:32:54.897 --> 00:32:57.843
We should go, or we're gonna be late.

00:32:57.876 --> 00:32:59.484
I'm sorry.

00:32:59.517 --> 00:33:01.525
It's just, i've never done this before.

00:33:03.265 --> 00:33:05.975
Look, i said i was sorry.

00:33:06.009 --> 00:33:07.782
Please...

00:33:15.513 --> 00:33:17.120
Stop it!

00:33:30.138 --> 00:33:32.079
Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:33:32.113 --> 00:33:35.125
Thank god! Thank god!

00:33:36.665 --> 00:33:37.768
Damn it.

00:33:37.801 --> 00:33:39.040
Are you sure you're okay?

00:33:39.073 --> 00:33:42.956
You have a cellphone? Call 911.

00:33:59.923 --> 00:34:01.864
Let us help you.

00:34:01.897 --> 00:34:04.107
No.

00:34:04.140 --> 00:34:06.951
It's time to rest,
thomas, to be at peace.

00:34:06.985 --> 00:34:10.432
Please. Let me give you last rites.

00:34:18.932 --> 00:34:20.673
O holy hosts above,

00:34:20.706 --> 00:34:23.517
I call upon thee as a servant of christ

00:34:23.552 --> 00:34:26.027
To sanctify our actions this day

00:34:26.061 --> 00:34:28.303
In fulfillment of the will of god.

00:34:34.696 --> 00:34:37.004
Fr. Reynolds?

00:34:37.037 --> 00:34:39.548
Rest.

00:34:49.320 --> 00:34:52.332
I call upon the archangel raphael,

00:34:52.365 --> 00:34:56.583
Master of the air, to make open the way.

00:34:56.616 --> 00:35:00.632
Let the fire of the
holy spirit now descend,

00:35:00.665 --> 00:35:05.317
That this being might be
awakened to the world beyond.

00:36:31.963 --> 00:36:33.669
Holy...

00:37:11.537 --> 00:37:13.411
<i>How was your day?</i>

00:37:21.477 --> 00:37:23.183
You were right.

00:37:25.258 --> 00:37:27.734
It wasn't an angel. It was gregory.

00:37:49.689 --> 00:37:52.701
I don't know, dean, i just...

00:37:57.721 --> 00:38:00.934
I wanted to believe...

00:38:00.967 --> 00:38:03.478
So badly.

00:38:05.418 --> 00:38:07.761
It's so damn
hard to do this --

00:38:07.794 --> 00:38:10.205
What
we do --

00:38:10.238 --> 00:38:13.718
All alone, you know?

00:38:13.751 --> 00:38:16.127
There's so much evil
out in the world, dean,

00:38:16.161 --> 00:38:18.671
I feel like i could drown in it.

00:38:18.705 --> 00:38:20.579
And when i think about my destiny,

00:38:20.613 --> 00:38:22.419
When i think about how i could end up...

00:38:22.453 --> 00:38:25.899
Yeah, well, don't worry
about that, all right?

00:38:25.933 --> 00:38:28.911
I'm watching out for you.

00:38:28.945 --> 00:38:31.154
Yeah, i know you are.

00:38:33.598 --> 00:38:36.040
But you're just one person, dean.

00:38:38.282 --> 00:38:40.022
And i needed to think

00:38:40.056 --> 00:38:42.901
That there was something
else watching, too, you know?

00:38:42.934 --> 00:38:47.586
Some...higher power,

00:38:47.620 --> 00:38:50.733
Some greater good.

00:38:52.373 --> 00:38:55.518
And that maybe...

00:38:55.551 --> 00:38:58.497
Maybe what?

00:39:01.374 --> 00:39:03.684
Maybe i could be saved.

00:39:10.377 --> 00:39:14.895
But, you know, that
just clouded my judgment.

00:39:14.929 --> 00:39:16.903
And you're right.

00:39:16.937 --> 00:39:19.446
I mean, we got to go with what we know,

00:39:19.481 --> 00:39:21.823
With what's right there in
front of our own two eyes.

00:39:21.857 --> 00:39:24.399
Well, it's funny you say that.

00:39:27.110 --> 00:39:28.114
Why?

00:39:31.226 --> 00:39:33.905
Gregory's spirit gave you
some pretty good information.

00:39:33.938 --> 00:39:37.150
That guy in the car was bad news.

00:39:37.183 --> 00:39:39.058
I barely got there in time.

00:39:39.091 --> 00:39:41.199
What happened?

00:39:41.233 --> 00:39:43.509
He's dead.

00:39:46.053 --> 00:39:47.759
Did you...

00:39:47.793 --> 00:39:49.065
No.

00:39:51.709 --> 00:39:54.754
But i'll tell you one thing.

00:39:54.787 --> 00:39:56.762
The way he died,

00:39:56.795 --> 00:39:59.372
If i hadn't have seen
it with my own two eyes,

00:39:59.406 --> 00:40:01.279
I never would have believed it.

00:40:01.313 --> 00:40:03.690
I mean...

00:40:03.723 --> 00:40:05.698
I don't know what to call it.

00:40:09.178 --> 00:40:10.550
What?

00:40:14.098 --> 00:40:15.838
Dean, what did you see?

00:40:18.247 --> 00:40:19.686
Maybe

00:40:24.205 --> 00:40:26.413
God's will.

00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:16.268
<font color="#ffff00" size=14>www.tvsubtitles.net</font>
